                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I had the beef rice bowl and it was rich, flavourful with a hint of spiciness. The portion is generous and their vanilla latte is one of the best ones I’ve had in Taiwan. Wasn’t able to try their dessert cause I was full but I highly recommend. The staff is friendly and they can speak English. They gave me a free juice for their opening and I’m honoured to have experienced their service.\nThank you! And hopefully I can visit again",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
